### 智能达人推荐系统 API 测试文件
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件或其他 HTTP 客户端工具测试

### 变量定义
@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000/api
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. 获取达人列表 (分页)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers?page=1&limit=10

### 3. 搜索达人
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers?search=测试&platform=douyin&gender=female

### 4. 获取达人统计信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers/stats

### 5. 创建新达人
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "canonical_name": "测试达人API",
  "main_platform": "douyin",
  "gender": "female",
  "city": "北京",
  "follower": 1000000,
  "interact_rate_within_30d": 0.05,
  "star_index": 85.5,
  "price_1_20": 5000,
  "price_20_60": 8000,
  "price_60": 12000,
  "is_excellent_author": true
}

### 6. 获取达人详情 (需要替换实际ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers/your-influencer-id-here

### 7. 更新达人信息 (需要替换实际ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers/your-influencer-id-here
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "canonical_name": "更新后的达人名称",
  "follower": 1200000,
  "interact_rate_within_30d": 0.06
}

### 8. 获取推荐达人
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/influencers/recommendations?limit=5&platform=douyin

### 9. 搜索达人 (高级搜索)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/influencers?keyword=测试&platform=douyin&followerCountMin=100000&engagementRateMin=0.03

### 10. 获取搜索建议
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/suggestions?keyword=测试

### 11. 批量删除达人 (需要替换实际ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/influencer-current/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": ["id1", "id2", "id3"]
}